	(text "PM1: CH1 VBUS_USER 20m (5 A FS), CH2 VBAT 20m (+-5 A, bidirectional), CH3 VSYS 20m (5 A), CH4 5V_SDR 50m (2 A)\nPM2: CH1 5V_LCD 50m (2 A), CH2 3V3_MCU 50m (2 A), CH3 3V3_SD 330m (300 mA), CH4 3V3_ETH 1R (100 mA)\nPM3: CH1 3V3_GPS 1R (100 mA), CH2 3V3_M1421 2.2R (45 mA), CH3 3V3_PERIPH 2.2R (45 mA), CH4 3V3 total 30m (3.3 A)\nFull scale (FS) = 100 mV / shunt; each sized for ~40-75 mV at the rail's expected peak.\nSense lines: Kelvin from each shunt (pins 2/3), routed as pairs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 190.5 0)
